{"ref":"BDB, קְטֹ֫רֶת","hw":"קְטֹ֫רֶת","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">קְטֹ֫רֶת</span></big><sub>60</sub>  <strong>n.f. smoke, odour of</strong> (burning) <strong>sacrifice, incense</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:1\" href=\"/Exodus.30.1\">Ex 30:1</a> +; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:6\" href=\"/Exodus.25.6\">25:6</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְטָרְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.18\">Ez 16:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:41\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.41\">23:41</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>sweet smoke of sacrifice</em>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מנחה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.13\">Is 1:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 141:2\" href=\"/Psalms.141.2\">ψ 141:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קְ׳ אֵילִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:15\" href=\"/Psalms.66.15\">66:15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַקְטִיר ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:28\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.28\">1 S 2:28</a> (?).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>incense</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ (ה)סמים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:6\" href=\"/Exodus.25.6\">Ex 25:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:7\" href=\"/Exodus.30.7\">30:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 31:11\" href=\"/Exodus.31.11\">31:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:27\" href=\"/Exodus.40.27\">40:27</a> + 9 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ תמיד</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:8\" href=\"/Exodus.30.8\">Ex 30:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ רֹקַח</span> v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:35\" href=\"/Exodus.30.35\">35</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הק׳</span> alone v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:37\" href=\"/Exodus.30.37\">37</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.13\">Lv 16:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:35\" href=\"/Numbers.16.35\">Nu 16:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:12\" href=\"/Numbers.17.12\">17:12</a>; so <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:7\" href=\"/Numbers.16.7\">16:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:17\" href=\"/Numbers.16.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:18\" href=\"/Numbers.16.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:5\" href=\"/Numbers.17.5\">17:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:11\" href=\"/Numbers.17.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.7\">2 Ch 29:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ זָרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:9\" href=\"/Exodus.30.9\">Ex 30:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ענן הק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.13\">Lv 16:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.11\">Ez 8:11</a>, also of <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁ זרה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 10:1\" href=\"/Leviticus.10.1\">Lv 10:1</a> (illegal worship); in offering of the princes <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:14\" href=\"/Numbers.7.14\">Nu 7:14</a> + 11 times <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:7\" href=\"/Numbers.7.7\">7</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:86\" href=\"/Numbers.7.86\">86</a>. Altar of incense is <span dir=\"rtl\">מזבח מקטר ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:1\" href=\"/Exodus.30.1\">Ex 30:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ הק׳ זהב</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.18\">1 Ch 28:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ הזהב לק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:5\" href=\"/Exodus.40.5\">Ex 40:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ ק׳ הסמים</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.7\">Lv 4:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ הק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:27\" href=\"/Exodus.30.27\">Ex 30:27</a> + 6 times<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>perfume</em>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁמֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.18\">Ez 16:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:41\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.41\">23:41</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.9\">Pr 27:9</a>.","next":"BDB, קָטַר","prev":"BDB, קְטוּרָה"}